      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential is delighted to present 72 Boot Road, a spacious and beautifully presented four-bedroom, extended semi-detached home, ideally located in the heart of Clondalkin.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a bright entrance hallway leading into a spacious living room, which seamlessly connects to a large open-plan kitchen/dining room with direct access to the rear garden. The ground floor also features a well-proportioned fourth bedroom overlooking the front of the property, along with a guest WC.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three generous bedrooms and a family bathroom, providing well-proportioned and versatile accommodation for modern family living.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, the property benefits from a private, low-maintenance garden featuring a combination of lawn and patio areas, ideal for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing. The garden is further complemented by two large sheds, offering excellent additional storage and the potential for use as a home office, gym or other purposes, subject to the relevant planning permissions. To the front, there is off-street parking.\r\n\r\nBoot Road is ideally positioned within walking distance of Clondalkin Village, which offers a wide range of amenities, including The Mill Shopping Centre, local schools, shops, bars, restaurants and leisure facilities. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with numerous bus routes, nearby train stations and easy access to the Red Luas Line. The M50 and N7 are also within close proximity, making commuting to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas both convenient and efficient.\r\n\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a turnkey family home in a highly convenient and well-connected location. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost care and attention have been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases, some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors, or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have.***"
      },
